Text Changer Application

Problem Statement:

Create a webpage that allows users to change the content of a paragraph dynamically using JavaScript DOM.

Requirements:

Display a heading and a paragraph with some default text.

Create three buttons:

Change Text

Uppercase

Reset Text

On clicking Change Text, replace the paragraph with new text.

On clicking Uppercase, convert the paragraph text into uppercase.

On clicking Reset Text, restore the original paragraph content.










Q5. Font Size Controller

Problem Statement:

Create a webpage that allows users to increase or decrease the font size of a paragraph dynamically.

Requirements:

Display a heading and a paragraph with some default content.

Create three buttons:

Increase Font Size

Decrease Font Size

Reset Font Size

On clicking Increase, increase the paragraph font size by 2px.

On clicking Decrease, decrease the paragraph font size by 2px.

On clicking Reset, restore the original font size.

Font size should not decrease below 10px or increase beyond 40px.










